x/sys v0.49.0 crashes ppc64le PIE binaries on any unix.Syscall*: its new
assembly wrappers jump to package syscall without setting R12, so the
callee computes a bad TOC pointer. Pin v0.48.0 until upstream fixes it:
https://github.com/golang/sys/commit/b6b8557e8e2974925aec7a136ba0e323eedc5f43

--- a/go.mod
+++ b/go.mod
@@ -16,3 +16,5 @@
 )
 
 require golang.org/x/sys v0.49.0 // indirect
+
+replace golang.org/x/sys => golang.org/x/sys v0.48.0
--- a/go.sum
+++ b/go.sum
@@ -10,6 +10,8 @@
